    "assumptions": [
      "Published conservative climate limits assume one Earth mass and their specified atmospheric composition.",
      "Albedo changes the separate blackbody energy balance, not the climate-model coefficients.",
      "Planet presets transfer orbital distance and Bond albedo; they do not model actual planetary atmospheres or change mass.",
      "The orbit is treated as circular at a constant semimajor-axis distance.",
      "Uniform heat redistribution, emissivity one, no greenhouse or internal heating in the equilibrium calculation.",
      "Teaching star temperatures and luminosities are independent; a main-sequence relation is not imposed.",
      "Measurement and model uncertainty are not propagated; zone membership does not establish habitability."
    ],
